// Coro golden of tests/fixtures/async/own/r2-defer-await-body-failure.oir (R2, C-6): closer is a D21 body whose
// Continue publishes an empty success; each invoke.defer of it is a suspension, and the body failure, the scope
// state and the resource live across it in the frame.
module defer_await_body_failure
